{"unit_id":"bihangchi9-creator__lark-agent-bridge#feature-1","repo":"bihangchi9-creator/lark-agent-bridge","commit":"5f5468ddf7a283f6f2f2111d105006cb5cfee60b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Lark Agent Bridge 的功能「群聊消息转成 agent 对话」：Lark Bridge 通过 Feishu/Lark 通道接收消息，把每条聊天映射到该群的 agent 会话，并将回复增量更新回消息。群聊可要求 @机器人触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/lark.ts:1"]}
{"unit_id":"bihangchi9-creator__lark-agent-bridge#feature-2","repo":"bihangchi9-creator/lark-agent-bridge","commit":"5f5468ddf7a283f6f2f2111d105006cb5cfee60b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Lark Agent Bridge 的功能「每个聊天独立工作区」：首次处理聊天时，桥接器按聊天 ID 在配置的 workspace 根目录下创建稳定项目目录，并以该目录作为 agent 的工作目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/workspace.ts:1"]}
